WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.925
The next shower, from where you are.

00:02.659 --> 00:08.679
This is your own sky in the middle of tonight, and the ring marks where the next shower's meteors will seem to come from.

00:09.221 --> 00:11.090
You do not need to stare at that point.

00:11.520 --> 00:13.365
Meteors appear all over the sky.

00:13.873 --> 00:17.078
The line below says which shower it is and when it peaks.
